## 18.2 Complete XSS Location-Specific Rule

```nginx
load_module /etc/nginx/modules/ngx_http_naxsi_module.so;

http {
    server {
        listen 80;
        server_name example.com;

        location / {
            SecRulesEnabled;
            DeniedUrl "/RequestDenied";

            BasicRule id:510900 "s:$XSS:8" "rx:<\s*script\b|on[a-z]+\s*=|javascript\s*:" "mz:ARGS|BODY|HEADERS" "msg:custom XSS indicators";

            CheckRule "$XSS >= 8" BLOCK;
        }

        location /RequestDenied {
            internal;
            return 403;
        }
    }
}
```

# 13. Attack-Specific Naxsi Rule Generation

## 13.1 XSS Configuration Pattern

Use when the attack type is:

```text
XSS
cross-site scripting
script tag
onerror
onload
javascript:
HTML injection
```

Recommended configuration:

```nginx
location / {
    SecRulesEnabled;
    LibInjectionXss;
    DeniedUrl "/RequestDenied";

    CheckRule "$XSS >= 8" BLOCK;
    CheckRule "$LIBINJECTION_XSS >= 8" BLOCK;
}
```

